────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Derived source (ported, not copied verbatim)
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

./diffhdr_runtime/colour.py
  The colour transfer functions and exposure-mask detection are ported from DiffHDR's
  utils/color_utils.py and infer_hdri.py (Apache License 2.0, as above). They are
  re-expressed for ComfyUI's IMAGE tensor layout but are numerically identical to the
  originals; tests/test_colour_parity.py asserts this against the vendored copies.

./diffhdr_runtime/windows.py
  The sliding-window schedule and temporal blend ramp are ported from DiffHDR's
  infer_long_video.py (Apache License 2.0, as above).

